The first spot of the week was scribbled in a Moleskine notebook before be=
ing faxed to London. It involved lions=2C mentioning that they were just c=
lose enough to camp for our tallest staff member (of only six)=2C Lenye=2C=
 to see them. Lenye is still with us.

