ampaign=3D44712ec1e9-Spot+of+the+Week+-+Kicheche_at_25_COPY_04&utm_medium=
=3Demail&utm_term=3D0_-f93f73ef7c-33796176

Twenty-five (25) years on=2C Paul and Greg=2C the founders=2C look a littl=
e older now; anyone would. With 170 staff and thousands of livelihoods dep=
ending on these four camps=2C they show no signs of hanging up their binoc=
ulars. They are just as determined to keep Kicheche at the vanguard of sus=
tainable tourism in the community conservancies they helped establish=2C q=
uite literally in this for the long game.

At ten years=2C Lenkume =E2=80=93 one of the =E2=80=98Kicheche Six=E2=80=
=99 =E2=80=93 accepted his long service award before turning to all the st=
aff and declaring: =E2=80=98Ten years still makes me a kijana (young boy).=
=2E. this is not something to brag about yet. I will talk if I=E2=80=99m sti=
ll here at 25 years.=E2=80=99

It was quite the soliloquy=2C and he is still here=2C and he is talking. W=
hat=E2=80=99s more=2C his son is now working with him at Mara Camp too=2C=
 joining the Kicheche family.

https://kicheche.com/kicheche-valley/?utm_source=3DRACK+-+agents+SOW&utm_c=
ampaign=3D44712ec1e9-Spot+of+the+Week+-+Kicheche_at_25_COPY_04&utm_medium=
=3Demail&utm_term=3D0_-f93f73ef7c-33796176

Are we going to celebrate? You bet we are=2C throughout 2025=2C culminatin=
g on October 15th in London.

The evening will feature bitings=2C sundowners=2C and rare and roar entert=
ainment as we mark 25 years of wilderness awakenings. Oh=2C and we need yo=
u there... all of you. Put it in your diary. Now.


